/**
 * The November 2026 platform-ownership pass: every passage that gave Firefly a campaign duty, and
 * what it says now (docs/ownership-2026-11/PHASE-1-2-REPORT.md, the task-to-function map).
 *
 * The new roles, in one line each:
 *   Firefly made the platform, owns it and runs it: hosting, deployment, maintenance, the data
 *   checks and new features. The campaign owns its content and data.
 *   Dr. Mulu's team analyses, decides, directs the publishing team, executes the strategies and
 *   updates the data, using the platform's functions.
 *
 * Each entry is an exact replacement. `all` replaces every occurrence (a lead fence repeats the
 * sentence that opens its section, and both must change together so the lead stays extractive).
 * scripts/ownership-2026-11/apply.mjs applies them and logs every content/ change to
 * docs/ownership-2026-11/ledger.json, which check:content reads. Nothing is cut: every passage is
 * reworded in place, its figures, names and acronyms kept.
 */
